{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1201","t":"Error, please ignore this","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1201","p":49,"im":[],"m":1201},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1202","t":"Morning guys, please comment on this one","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1202","p":49,"im":[],"m":1202},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1203","t":"Al3cs wrote: Morning guys, please comment on this one\n\nhey Al3cs\n\nhere is how i see NZDUSD. Also i tried to look at the chart as an IT and try to see the market in term of order flow and how they can provide liquidity for their orders hope it makes sense\n\nRegards omid","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1203","p":49,"im":["1c961a04c5cba3dc02f03ad0f18be8d83bcae445","ca9071df5bed4409fb97ea0bd4212862419b6e34"],"m":1203},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1204","t":"Away\n\nI love this one, I have not been able to take it as I wasn't behind a screen at this time, but it is beautiful","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1204","p":49,"im":["a70bd99ca71f13f7ec59c99a2ceeb97f371a17f3"],"m":1204},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1205","t":"Hi all. I'm completely new to this kind of analysis and I've only just started looking around on this site, so don't be too hard on me\n\nI just wanted to check if I got the QM concept somewhat right here. One at the top and now a potential bullish one in this area.. or?\n\nGreat site btw. I'm really looking forward to start studying!\n\nwww.tradingview.com/x/gXkT04eo/","a":"BaliShag","d":"","n":"#1205","p":49,"im":["0bb3acef885a6d563123735008e25af6743f4ad8"],"m":1205},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1206","t":"BaliShag wrote: Hi all. I'm completely new to this kind of analysis and I've only just started looking around on this site, so don't be too hard on me\n\nI just wanted to check if I got the QM concept somewhat right here. One at the top and now a potential bullish one in this area.. or?\n\nGreat site btw. I'm really looking forward to start studying!\n\nwww.tradingview.com/x/gXkT04eo/\n\nHey BaliShag\n\nWelcome to RTM where you will learn how to Read The Market\n\nRTM is like a puzzle! you have to put all the pieces together to get a clearer picture In RTM we are not looking for patterns.Actually QM is a concept and there are a lot of psychology behind it, playing with retailers emotions! and we are not looking for them every where! and if you just want to trade them wherever you find them, they can be failed easily! where are looking for them only in certain zones!\n\nSo take your time and and go thorough all the concepts and HWs step by step and put them all together then you can see what is behind QMs and how amazing they work!\n\nRegards omid","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#1206","p":49,"im":["0bb3acef885a6d563123735008e25af6743f4ad8"],"m":1206},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1207","t":"Daily FTR/DEMAND @13.04.2015\n\nLEFT SHOULDER and HEAD @ 25.11. - 03.12.2015\n\nRIGHT SHOULDER current time...","a":"valtrg","d":"","n":"#1207","p":49,"im":["4944229395da570400605fcac2077ede45bf9d4f"],"m":1207},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1208","t":"valtrg wrote: Daily FTR/DEMAND @13.04.2015\n\nLEFT SHOULDER and HEAD @ 25.11. - 03.12.2015\n\nRIGHT SHOULDER current time...\n\nHi Valtrg. The High where the blue line is marked was never taken out after the head was formed and before the return of the right shoulder so its not strictly a QM. Keep going with it my friend.","a":"Edge","d":"","n":"#1208","p":49,"im":[],"m":1208},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1209","t":"2 in 1","a":"mertch","d":"","n":"#1209","p":49,"im":["db80eda0d0b56cfb69a6410561534ba63504c8f0"],"m":1209},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1210","t":"Still running... not sure about the LL though.. seems it has hit the target. Correct if wrong.\n\nHTF\n\nLTF","a":"ViTaLDRuG","d":"","n":"#1210","p":49,"im":["c9acd76414970bdbc9abc6b79794897239949907","4e1a009ef685ba24fda83493e64630723358e26d"],"m":1210},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1211","t":"by IF: Fakeouts are extremely easy to predict. Most SD traders still look directly left, which is the big shortcoming of Supply/Demand trading. It's further left again we should be looking. Say price is coming up to a supply. The only way we can be sure that supply will hold price down is if that supply has already visited the extreme set of orders in the flag limit to its left. If the supply fell short of that, we can anticipate a FO to those extreme orders. Extremely simple stuff. We always look to what S or D are reactions to, rather than just S or D themselves.\n\none more from Pedini: www.readthemarket.com/index.php/en/forum...tups? start=325#22279","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1211","p":49,"im":["a079862cf03a4b1e3fc1c68de713b494d62905f5"],"m":1211},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1212","t":"attachment missed","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1212","p":49,"im":["a079862cf03a4b1e3fc1c68de713b494d62905f5"],"m":1212},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1213","t":"Morning all, I was reading once again this whole thread and took the time to try to answer to this question IF asked about a failed QM:\n\nIfmyante wrote:\n\nofshen wrote: another on, but it failed.\n\nThis is my answer, please anyone take the time to review and correct it. Thanks in advance","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1213","p":49,"im":["bf3577ba97f83edc79beeb473dcee65783e38146","89ef0045b85776ff79682b9ecc907692e690c6f5"],"m":1213},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1214","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1214","p":49,"im":["10945403eaadadd0a0dd4350ce309857932b7a20"],"m":1214},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1215","t":"My first QM homework","a":"GGJJ","d":"","n":"#1215","p":49,"im":["bc38151f93c000c92bd30fbb746467672d47d28d","4f33ce0ea86229fe174d594ca377eebf8cff2875"],"m":1215},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1216","t":"","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#1216","p":49,"im":["0741dabaed2c5f41a3b9fc26c3a317d1b6aec5bf"],"m":1216},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1217","t":"QM on NYMEX Crude 5 and 1 min","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#1217","p":49,"im":["cf7c5004e16a572579465c31ac7cfb18a5476e62","eb3d26a3877b96ddb23367d5742a4262572749fa"],"m":1217},{"id":"quasimodo_p49_1218","t":"Please correct if anything wrong GOLD","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#1218","p":49,"im":["9ea1e3595cea77e4384543dcd419fd5d1c6156cb","f8304cb840e82f